-         |    with red background=color    |                              |||
-         ===================================    45px (2.25em)           \ ||| /
-         |inter-column spacing 10px (0.5em)|                             \   /
-         |    with red background=color    |                              \ /
-         ===================================    55px (2.75em)              v
-         |  height of 2nd td 10px (0.5em)  |
-         |    with red background=color    |
-         ===================================    65px (3.25em)
-         |logical left border-spacing: 10px|                              |||
-         |    with red background=color    |                              |||
-         ===================================    75px (3.75em)           \ ||| /
-         |tble padding-bottom 25px (1.25em)|                             \   /
-         |    with red background=color    |                              \ /
-         |    with red background=color    |                               v
-         |    with red background=color    |
-         |    with red background=color    |
-         ===================================   100px (5em)              BOTTOM
-
-  */
